 null, "timestamp": "2024-08-28T15:53:55.895Z", "public": true, "deleted": false, "emailed": false, "data": null}}, {"model": "notifications.notification", "pk": 14, "fields": {"level": "info", "recipient": 1, "unread": true, "actor_content_type": 4, "actor_object_id": "1", "verb": "commented on your post", "description": "beautiful", "target_content_type": null, "target_object_id": null, "action_object_content_type": null, "action_object_object_id": null, "timestamp": "2024-08-28T16:02:44.409Z", "public": true, "deleted": false, "emailed": false, "data": null}}, {"model": "user.profile", "pk": 1, "fields": {"bio": "this is me", "user": 1, "profile_picture": "profile_pictures/profile_pic_blank.png", "followers": [1], "blocked": []}}, {"model": "user.follow", "pk": 1, "fields": {"follower": 1, "follower_following": [1]}}, {"model": "person.category", "pk": 1, "fields": {"name": "Christian"}}, {"model": "person.category", "pk": 2, "fields": {"name": "Bible Study"}}, {"model": "person.category", "pk": 3, "fields": {"name": "Jesus"}}, {"model": "person.category", "pk": 4, "fields": {"name": "Prophecy"}}, {"model": "person.video", "pk": 1, "fields": {"user": 1, "title": "Jesus Have It ALL", "description": "", "video_file": "videos/Jesus_Have_It_All_Spontaneous_-_UPPERROOM_9sxPxYZ.mp4", "created_at": "2024-08-28T10:44:57.461Z", "category": 1, "privacy": "public", "likes": [], "views": [1], "tags": [1], "saves": [1]}}, {"model": "person.post", "pk": 1, "fields": {"user": 1, "title": "Insiped", "content": "<p class=\"aLF-aPX-K0-aPE\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Heavenly Father, Lord Jesus, Holy Spirit Thank you for Your goodness that is never ending, Your mercy From endures forever for your faithfulness that reaches across the heavens and the free gift of eternal life I have been given through the blood of the Lord Jesus. Thank You for sending your Spirit to dwell within me. Lord God Almighty, right now I ask in the name of your only begotten Son Christ Jesus that You pour out Your love into my heart through Your Holy Spirit, that I dwell in Your house all the days of my life. LORD God thank You that Your mercy is everlasting and Your love's never-ending, Right now I ask Heavenly Father have mercy on me, for You have mercy on the righteous for 1000 generations. Heal my heart with the oil of Your Spirit, the oil of the Holy Spirit, Thank you, Jesus, for Your blood. Lord I thank You that I'm justified by the blood of the only begotten son of God, Your Son Jesus Christ. Thank you, heavenly Father, Lord Jesus, Holy Spirit. Thank you Holy Spirit for making me Your temple. Heavenly Father I ask right now in the name of your only begotten Son Jesus Christ that according to your grace and mercy, I receive the abundance of grace and the free gift I have through the sacrifice of the lamb of God Your Son, the Lord Jesus Christ. Right Heavenly Father, Lord Jesus and Holy Spirit I present my members as both an instrument and slave to righteousness, purify me to be pure as you are pure O'Lord, lead me into all righteousness continue to sanctify my heart, mind, will, soul, and spirit going from glory to glory. Right now I pray Lord Jesus that I be united with Your death and resurrection, that the body of sin be brought to nothing, to be a slave and bondservant to of you, Lord Jesus. Lord Jesus, I present to you my body as a living sacrifice, that I may live in You, to abide in You O'Lord to abide in the house of the Lord all the days of my life. No longer enslaved to the elementary principles of the world and perfected in Christ, dead to sin and alive in You Lord Almighty. In Jesus' name I pray that You make me your dwelling place to go from everlasting to everlasting strengthen me in righteousness, make me Holy as You are Holy, set me apart for Your purposes, let Your will for my life come to pass, and now I dismantle and destroy the enemies plan for my life in Jesus name with the fire of God and the blood of Jesus. I am the property of Jesus. I am the temple of the Holy Spirit. I have been grafted into the branch. Christ the firstborn of God paid for me with his blood, so I may become a child of God, for a slave does not remain in the house forever, but a son remains forever. Whom the Son sets free is free indeed, by the precious blood I have been set free. Thank you, Lord, that You set me free. Thank you, Lord, that You have delivered me. Thank you Heavenly Father for sending Your Son. Jesus thank you for laying down Your life. You said Lord Jesus that those who humble themselves will be exalted, that you will rescue them in times of trouble. Lord, right now I humble myself before Your throne and ask according to Your mercy that You come to my rescue, that Your will be done, that You be my guide and shepherd. Shepherd the pastures of my heart, lead me In paths of righteousness for Your name's sake, that I may delight in the laws of the LORD all the days of my life. Thank you Lord that You are my refugee, You are my hope according to Your mercy deliver me from the snare and fowler, be to me a guiding light. Let my dwelling place be under the shadow of your wings heavenly Father. LORD You are you are my light of life and my hope. sanctify my heart, to be pure as you are pure. For the pure in heart shall see God, let Your face shine upon me. Thank you LORD that You are restoring my heart, lift me upon eagles wings, be to me a hiding place a stronghold in the day of trouble. Holy Holy Holy are You LORD God Almighty, Your mercy endures forever. Thank You, Lord, that I can trust in You, that I am Yours, I belong to You, be with me now and forevermore. In Jesus name, I pray, amen.</span></p>", "created_at": "2024-08-28T15:27:23.820Z", "category": 1, "privacy": "public", "likes": [], "views": [1], "tags": [1], "saves": []}}, {"model": "person.image", "pk": 1, "fields": {"user": 1, "title": "Jesus and A Lamb", "description": "", "image": "postimages/jesus-holding-a-lamb_3j1pmUs.jpg", "created_at": "2024-08-28T09:56:21.636Z", "privacy": "public", "likes": [], "views": [1], "tags_img": [3], "saves": []}}, {"model": "person.image", "pk": 2, "fields": {"user": 1, "title": "As the deet pants for water", "description": "", "image": "postimages/dee-pants-for-water_AhEvBBm.jpg", "created_at": "2024-08-28T10:25:13.860Z", "privacy": "public", "likes": [], "views": [1], "tags_img": [1], "saves": []}}, {"model": "person.blogpost", "pk": 1, "fields": {"title": "Music I Listen to", "content": "<h1>Fav Songs&nbsp;</h1>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Jesus Have it all</li>\r\n<li>I exalt thee&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>pour my love&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>I stand in awe of thee</li>\r\n<li>as a deer pants for water&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>", "created_at": "2024-08-28T15:53:10.557Z", "updated_at": "2024-08-28T15:53:10.557Z", "created_by": 1, "privacy": "public", "likes": [], "views": [1], "tags": [], "saves": [1]}}, {"model": "person.commentsblog", "pk": 1, "fields": {"blog": 1, "created_by": 1, "body": "beautiful", "date": "2024-08-28T16:02:44.399Z", "parent": null}}, {"model": "person.board", "pk": 1, "fields": {"user": 1, "title": "Christian", "description": "", "privacy": "public"}}, {"model": "person.boardimage", "pk": 1, "fields": {"board": 1, "image": 1, "order": 2}}, {"model": "person.boardimage", "pk": 2, "fields": {"board": 1, "image": 2, "order": 1}}, {"model": "person.boardvideo", "pk": 1, "fields": {"board": 1, "video": 1, "order": 0}}, {"model": "person.boardpost", "pk": 1, "fields": {"board": 1, "post": 1, "order": 2}}